  <point name="info_player_intermission" color="1 0 1" box="-16 -16 -16 16 16 16">
Camera for intermission screen between matches. Can be aimed by setting the "angles" key or targeting an pointing to an aiming entity. Use only one per level. (updated: 12/08/2005)
