<!--
=============================================================================

 LIGHT ENTITY

=============================================================================
-->

  <point name="light" color=".65 .65 1" box="-8 -8 -8 8 8 8">
Non-displayed point, spot or sun light source. Pointed lights become spotlights.
A sun is created when the sun key is present; aim it with target or angles.
-------- KEYS --------
<real key="light" name="Intensity">Light intensity (default 300).</real>
<color key="_color" name="Light Color">Light color (float RGB, int RGB, or #RRGGBB). Derived from lightimage if omitted.</color>
<integer key="style" name="Light Style">Legacy dynamic light style. NOTE: currently broken in makebsp; use realtime lights instead.</integer>
<real key="radius" name="Spot Radius">Spotlight radius at the target point (default 64).</real>
<real key="softness" name="Spot Softness">Spotlight edge softness (default 1).</real>
<real key="backsplash" name="Backsplash">Spotlight backsplash fraction (default 0.1).</real>
<target key="target" name="Target">Aiming target; makes the light a spotlight.</target>
<direction key="dir" name="Direction">Spotlight aim direction (alternative to target).</direction>
<angles key="angles" name="Pitch Yaw Roll">Spotlight/sun aim angles.</angles>
<boolean key="sun" name="Sun Light">Presence marks this light as a sun.</boolean>
-------- FALLOFF / CULLING --------
<string key="attenuation" name="Falloff Model">standard, soft, linear, unreal, smoothstep. The LINEAR_ATTN spawnflag forces linear.</string>
<real key="atten_distscale" name="Distance Scale">Falloff distance scale; 0.5 doubles the reach.</real>
<real key="atten_anglescale" name="Angle Scale">Angular falloff scale.</real>
<real key="cutoff" name="Cutoff">Auto-scaled cutoff anchor for culling.</real>
<real key="energycutoff" name="Absolute Energy Cutoff">Absolute energy cull threshold.</real>
<real key="fadeout" name="Fade Out">Fraction of light reach used for a soft fade.</real>
<real key="prestep" name="Singularity Offset">Offset of the light singularity (default 16). Aliases: rampoffset, extradist.</real>
-------- LIGHTMAP / GRID --------
<real key="grid_ambientscale" name="Grid Ambient Scale">Multiplier for ambient contribution to the lightgrid.</real>
<real key="grid_directscale" name="Grid Direct Scale">Multiplier for direct contribution to the lightgrid.</real>
<real key="grid_maxambient" name="Grid Max Ambient">Ambient grid luma cap (0 = uncapped).</real>
<real key="grid_maxdirect" name="Grid Max Direct">Direct grid luma cap (0 = uncapped).</real>
<boolean key="nodeluxe" name="No Deluxe">Exclude this light from deluxe direction maps.</boolean>
<boolean key="backsplash_nodeluxe" name="No Backsplash Deluxe">Exclude backsplash from deluxe direction maps.</boolean>
<texture key="lightimage" name="Color From Shader">Derive the light color from a shader's average color.</texture>
<texture key="haloshader" name="Halo Shader">Light halo shader ("none" or "0" disables).</texture>
<real key="haloscale" name="Halo Scale">Halo size multiplier (default 1).</real>
-------- SPAWNFLAGS --------
<flag key="LINEAR_ATTN" name="Linear Attn" bit="0">Use linear distance falloff (read by makebsp). Equivalent to the attenuation key set to linear.</flag>
<flag key="START_OFF" name="Start Off" bit="6">Light starts switched off (game spawnflag).</flag>
-------- NOTES --------
Legacy spawnflag bits 2 (NOANGLE_ATTN), 4 (DARK_LIGHT), 16 (NO_GRID) and 32 (NO_COLOR_NORMALIZE) are no longer read by the game or the compiler.
  </point>


